  "id": "sum-of-squares",
  "term": "sum of squares",
  "definition": "Sum of squares is a total made by squaring and adding deviations or prediction errors. In linear regression, it refers to the total of squared prediction errors; in analysis of variance, it refers to the total of squared deviations from cell means or, for within-subject factors, the Subjects × Treatment interaction.",
